<div class="page title-page">
  <div>
    <div class="dossier-tag">HISTORICAL FEATURE &bull; STREAM OF CONSCIOUSNESS &bull; 60 MIN</div>
    <div class="main-title">LEBEN MIT EINEM KRIEGSVERBRECHER</div>
    <div class="alt-title">LIFE WITH A WAR CRIMINAL</div>
    <div class="draft-meta">Dramatized from the Recollections of Lina Heydrich<br>
    Musical Score Anchored on J.S. Bach</div>
  </div>

  <div class="credits-block">
    <div class="author">SCREENPLAY ADAPTATION</div>
    <div>Incorporating the Historical Screening of Jiří Sequens’s <em>Atentát</em> (1965)</div>
    <br>
    <div>A portrait of selective memory, maternal terror, and the relics of power.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="historical-box">
    <strong>DOCUMENTARY CONTEXT:</strong><br>
    All musical cues are drawn from Johann Sebastian Bach (Sonatas &amp; Partitas for Solo Violin, and the Double Violin Concerto in D Minor, BWV 1043). The narrative framing begins inside an authentic 1965 Berlin screening of the Czechoslovak film <em>Atentát</em>, which Lina Heydrich attended in historical fact.
  </div>
